,"cohort":"16-19, 18-24","polarity":"higher_is_worse","description":"Field 'Latest overall effectiveness before renewed EIF' (1 Outstanding, 2 Good, 3 Requires improvement, 4 Inadequate) for each FE and skills provider whose Ofsted record places it in Bedford, Central Bedfordshire or Luton. Null = no graded inspection under the old framework (new providers). Report-card grades from inspections under the renewed EIF (from 10 Nov 2025; no single overall grade) are in attrs.report_card; the legacy grade may predate them."},{"id":"ofsted_fe_rc_below_expected","label":"Report-card evaluation areas below expected standard (renewed EIF)","unit":"count","cohort":"16-19, 18-24","polarity":"higher_is_worse","description":"For providers inspected under the renewed EIF report-card format: number of graded evaluation areas judged 'Needs attention' or 'Urgent improvement' (scale: Exceptional, Strong standard, Expected standard, Needs attention, Urgent improvement). Full text grades in attrs.report_card."},{"id":"ofsted_fe_providers","label":"FE and skills providers in Ofsted's inspection remit","unit":"count","cohort":"16-19, 18-24","polarity":"neutral","description":"Number of FE and skills providers (colleges, independent learning providers, employer providers, local authority providers, HEIs with apprenticeships, 16-19 academies, dance and drama colleges) recorded against the area in the Ofsted MI."},{"id":"ofsted_fe_grade_count","label":"FE and skills providers by latest legacy overall grade","unit":"count","cohort":"16-19, 18-24","polarity":"neutral","description":"Count of providers by 'Latest overall effectiveness before renewed EIF'; breakdown = grade."},{"id":"ofsted_fe_pct_good_plus","label":"% of graded FE and skills providers good or outstanding","unit":"percent","cohort":"16-19, 18-24","polarity":"higher_is_better","description":"Providers graded 1 or 2 / providers with a legacy overall grade x 100 (num/den given; Bedfordshire total recomputed from summed counts)."},